stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RawIngested : CSV parsed
    RawIngested : raw_payload_snapshot set<br/>cleansed_payload = null

    RawIngested --> CleansePassed : regex + gemini cleanse
    RawIngested --> QuarantineFailed : hostile pattern detected

    CleansePassed : cleansed_payload populated<br/>updated_at timestamp set

    QuarantineFailed : cleansed_payload = null<br/>logged to cleaningissues.md

    CleansePassed --> [*] : persist to Database.json
    QuarantineFailed --> [*] : persist to Database.json

    CleansePassed --> ReCleanse : new cleanse rules / re-run
    QuarantineFailed --> RawIngested : manual review clears

    ReCleanse : re-read raw_payload_snapshot<br/>re-generate cleansed_payload

    ReCleanse --> CleansePassed : cleanse succeeds
    ReCleanse --> QuarantineFailed : still hostile

    note right of RawIngested
        Ingest pipeline sets this state.
        raw_payload_snapshot is immutable
        from this point forward.
    end note

    note right of CleansePassed
        The raw_payload_snapshot
        remains pristine for audit.
        Only cleansed_payload is mutated.
    end note
